# Managed work

This is the human navigation view for consequential work. Package `README.md` files own state;
reconcile this index from them instead of editing status here independently.

Create a package only when work must survive a session or agent boundary, has a dependency or review
gate, carries meaningful uncertainty, requires durable evidence, or the user asks to track it.
Routine same-turn work needs no package.

Package rows use:

```text
- [{WORK_ID}]({PACKAGE_FOLDER}/README.md) — {STATUS} — {OWNER} — updated {YYYY-MM-DD}
```

